        "description": "Temporary controlled test mechanism using X-TOWN-Control-Key. This is not public authentication. Idempotent PUT: first request creates the confirmation; repeats return the same confirmedAt. Body must be empty. No public counts or actor identifiers are exposed.",
        "parameters": [
          {
